sentences.l:
Truth-body, Boundless-Appearance, Measureless-Light;
perfect-enjoyment-body, the Lotus peaceful-and-wrathful's gods;
Lotus-Born, emanation-body, of-beings the protector:
three-bodies lamas (plural) to, I-bow.

sentences.i:
To the body of truth, Amitābha of boundless light;
to the body of perfect enjoyment, the peaceful and wrathful deities of the Lotus family;
to the body of emanation, Padmasambhava, protector of beings:
to the lamas of the three bodies I bow.

sentences.l:
First, the preliminary's embodied-ones being-freed, as-for:
guidance's stages at-the-first into-experience taken;
faculties best (plural), by guidance certainly freed.

By-that not freed if, death-point's between in:
the Transference, Remembering Self-Freed, into-experience taken;
by-that, yogins middling (plural) certainly freed.
